  "key_findings": [
    "PatchCore achieves 0.9651 mean AUROC, the strongest fully-unsupervised anomaly detector evaluated.",
    "Leak-free supervised EfficientNet-B0 reaches 0.9732 mean AUROC on the shared benchmark, competitive with PatchCore despite using far less labeled data than a full supervised pipeline would typically require.",
    "Grad-CAM (classification-head based) achieves only 0.1841505154639175 mean IoU against ground truth, motivating the need for dedicated localization methods (PaDiM, PatchCore) used elsewhere in this pipeline.",
    "Uncertainty-based active learning concentrates 48.0% of total model errors within roughly 10% of the review budget, demonstrating meaningful labeling-effort reduction.",
    "Drift detection shows a clean escalating response across clean/natural/corrupted production streams, validating that both KL divergence and embedding distance distinguish genuine distribution shift from normal variation."
